{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>After the death.</b> After He warned Israel lest they die, HaShem said to Moses that he should also warn Aaron lest he die as his sons died, and this pericope is a sign that the sons of Aaron brought the incense inside the curtain:" "And the word <b>בקרבתם</b> is a verb, and the he is for drawing near to the task in which [they were engaged]; its tav is in accordance with the pattern of the feminine he. And Rabbi Yeshuah erred in saying that it is a noun in the pattern of חכמתם."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:22.073062707Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}